      "expect": {
        "comment": "The rounding case, and the reason the group base is ALLOCATED rather than recomputed per line. Group gross 20.01 -> tax 20.01 x 20 / 120 = 3.335 -> 3.34 half-up, base 16.67. Split by largest remainder over 10.00 and 10.01: 8.33 + 8.34 = 16.67 exactly. Two per-line recomputations would each round and could hand back a group a cent off the amount that was actually posted.",
        "result": {
